05:09.450 --> 05:11.160
So chapter one.

05:11.160 --> 05:13.470
I'll just leave the outline and the characters.

05:13.470 --> 05:16.440
So now, whoops, this is all we have.

05:16.440 --> 05:18.030
I'm on a branch though called empty.

05:18.030 --> 05:21.210
